<section class="ah-admin-panel admissions-panel" data-staff-admissions aria-labelledby="admissions-title" hidden>
  <div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><span class="ah-admin-eyebrow">EACH PERSON COUNTS</span><h2 id="admissions-title">实际人数、候补与团队</h2><p>300 是所有参会人员与工作人员的共同上限。团队关联不会新增人数，团队预估人数不代表已登记成员；审核意见与实际名额分别记录。</p></div><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-admissions-refresh>刷新名额</button></div>
  <p class="ah-admin-status" data-admissions-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="ah-admin-alert" data-admissions-error role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
  <div class="admissions-pending" data-admissions-pending hidden><p>操作结果尚未确认，填写内容仍保留。请确认同一操作结果后再新增操作，避免重复登记。</p><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-admissions-retry>再次确认同一操作</button></div>
  <div class="review-metrics" data-admissions-metrics></div>
  <form class="admissions-settings" data-admissions-settings data-admissions-superadmin><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-reserve">工作人员预留名额</label><input id="admission-reserve" name="staffReserve" type="number" min="0" max="300" step="1" required /><small>预设 0。此数占用共同上限，不会额外增加人数；减少预留可能让候补转正。</small></div><label><input name="waitlistEnabled" type="checkbox" />普通名额满额后接受候补</label><button class="ah-admin-button" type="submit">保存名额设置</button></form>
  <div class="contacts-action-row"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-admissions-promote>按候补顺序补足空位</button><p class="ah-admin-small">系统按每人的登记顺序及适用名额补位；候补登记尚未取得参会名额，也不会获得群码。</p></div>
  <details class="admissions-people"><summary>每位已登记人员的实际名额</summary><div class="ah-admin-table-wrap"><table class="review-table"><caption class="ah-sr-only">每人一笔名额状态，按登记顺序排列</caption><thead><tr><th>人员 / 编号</th><th>名额状态</th><th>类别</th><th>团队</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody data-admissions-people></tbody></table></div><p class="ah-admin-small">点击编号查看本人资料。取消会释放实际名额并按顺序补位；本页不会自动发送通知。</p></details>
  <details class="admissions-forms"><summary>关联团队成员</summary><p>请先为每位成员分别登记，再把实际报名关联为团队。每人最多属于一个团队，最多 50 位成员；删除团队关联不会取消任何人的名额。</p><form data-admissions-team><input name="id" type="hidden" /><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-team-name">团队名称</label><input id="admission-team-name" name="name" maxlength="160" required /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-team-members">实际已登记成员（可多选）</label><select id="admission-team-members" name="memberIds" multiple size="7" required></select><small>按住 Ctrl / Command 可多选；手机可使用系统选择器。编号来自逐人已保存的登记。</small></div><div class="contacts-action-row"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="submit">保存团队关联</button><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-admissions-team-reset>新增 / 取消编辑</button></div></form><div data-admissions-teams></div></details>
  <details class="admissions-forms" data-admissions-superadmin><summary>工作人员 / 受托逐人登记</summary><p>仅记录已获联络与登记许可的实际一人。本人未在网站勾选的隐私同意不会被代填；保存后仍须按名额结果核对。</p><form data-admissions-staff><div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-staff-name">本人姓名</label><input id="admission-staff-name" name="name" maxlength="120" required /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-staff-kind">名额类别</label><select id="admission-staff-kind" name="kind"><option value="crew">工作人员</option><option value="attendee">一般参会</option></select></div></div><div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-staff-email">邮箱（与微信至少一项）</label><input id="admission-staff-email" name="email" type="email" maxlength="254" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-staff-wechat">微信（与邮箱至少一项）</label><input id="admission-staff-wechat" name="wechat" maxlength="120" /></div></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="admission-staff-permission">联络与登记许可依据</label><input id="admission-staff-permission" name="permissionReference" maxlength="500" required /><small>例如已核定的本人确认记录编号；避免重复输入无关敏感资料。</small></div><label><input name="confirmed" type="checkbox" required />已核对本人资料及登记许可；只登记这一人，不代填本人网站同意</label><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit">保存实际一人登记</button></form></details>
</section>
